PRIOR ART STATEMENT
-------------------
The core technical innovation of RED-ARITH — representing numerical
values as (main value M + explicit residue label k + denominator D),
with residue scaling during arithmetic operations to ensure
deterministic, audit-friendly, and zero-floating-point-error results —
was first publicly disclosed by Liu Yijing in July 2026. 

Any patent application filed after this disclosure that covers the 
same or equivalent technical scheme may be subject to invalidation 
based on this prior art.

This project is intended to serve as an open-source reference
implementation for deterministic numerical computation in high-stakes
financial and scientific applications.

